meta-ojt
========

Yocto layer of the OJT USB Video Player project (Raspberry Pi 4, branch scarthgap).
Full documentation: ../../../docs/README.md

Dependencies (all branch scarthgap, cloned by scripts/setup-layers.sh)
----------------------------------------------------------------------
  poky               https://git.yoctoproject.org/poky
  meta-raspberrypi   https://github.com/agherzan/meta-raspberrypi
  meta-openembedded  https://github.com/openembedded/meta-openembedded  (meta-oe)
  meta-qt5           https://github.com/meta-qt5/meta-qt5

Contents
--------
  conf/layer.conf
  recipes-bsp/bootsfile/rpi-config_%.bbappend      UART, SPI, MCP2515 overlay (CAN_OSCILLATOR, INT GPIO25)
  recipes-core/images/core-image-minimal.bbappend  adds the services below to core-image-minimal
  recipes-core/network-config                      eth0 static IP 192.168.2.20/24
  recipes-multimedia/media-manager                 C: USB detect/mount/scan, D-Bus org.automotive.MediaManager
  recipes-multimedia/video-player                  C++: GStreamer player, D-Bus org.automotive.VideoPlayer
                                                   (package video-player-testdata: sample videos)
  recipes-qt/ojt-gui                               C++/Qt5 HMI (X11 via xinit)
  recipes-connectivity/can-service                 C: CAN 0x100 -> D-Bus, STATUS/RESPONSE/HEALTH -> CAN
                                                   (package can-service-test: can-test.sh + can-utils)

Adding the layer
----------------
  bitbake-layers add-layer <repo>/rasp/custom-source/meta-ojt
